<projectDescription>
	<name>FreeRTOS_nRF52832_KvbSuite</name>
	<comment>KVB benchmark suite on FreeRTOS for nRF52-DK (PCA10040) board.  Sibling of TaktOS_nRF52832_KvbSuite — same shared platform/test set, FreeRTOS swapped for TaktOS as the kernel under test.</comment>
